e. Privacy of information. No information that is required to be reported pursuant to this section shall be reported in a manner that would violate any applicable provision of federal, state, local law, or rules or regulations relating to the privacy of any individual or any decedent, or that would interfere with law enforcement investigations or otherwise conflict with the interests of any law enforcement agency.

